OL,3,GNEWSACross-Channel ferry route ends
OL,4,Aearlier than planned
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cross-Channel ferry route is to be
OL,7,Fshut down earlier than planned
OL,8,Ffollowing a technical problem with a
OL,9,Fship.
OL,11,FBrittany Ferries announced earlier this
OL,12,Fyear that its last sailing between
OL,13,FPortsmouth and Le Havre would be on 28
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FIt said an issue with the Commodore
OL,17,FClipper vessel meant it could no longer
OL,18,Fcomplete its final sailings. Travellers
OL,19,Falready booked can transfer to other
OL,20,Fcrossings or get a full refund.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
